                    <p>Yes. Helpful questions include: How long will the scar be, and which way will it run? Will you close it directly, or might it need a graft or flap? What helps it heal &mdash; scar massage, taping, <a href="/prevention" class="text-teal hover:text-teal/80 hover:underline transition-colors">sun protection</a>? When can I exercise again? What is normal, and what signals infection? Asking before surgery lets you plan clothing and time off work.</p>
